OL,3,GNEWSARape-accused invented alcohol
OL,4,Aconcerns, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man on trial for rape has been
OL,7,Faccused of inventing his claim that he
OL,8,Fexpressed concerns to a woman's husband
OL,9,Fabout her being drunk, a court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FRichard Wilkins, 62, is one of four men
OL,13,Faccused of sexual offences against
OL,14,FJoanne Young, who was drugged and raped
OL,15,Fby her ex-husband Philip Young over 13
OL,16,Fyears at their Swindon home.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
