OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1793805990
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSARape-accused invented alcohol
OL,4,Aconcerns, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilkins is on trial at Winchester Crown
OL,7,FCourt with Norman Macksoni, 48, Connor
OL,8,FSanderson-Doyle, 32, and Mohammed
OL,9,FHassan, 38. They all deny sexual
OL,10,Foffences against Joanne, who has waived
OL,11,Fher right to anonymity.
OL,13,FSarah Jones KC, prosecuting, claimed
OL,14,FWilkins did not raise any concerns
OL,15,Fabout Joanne and "was not bothered if
OL,16,Fshe was drunk or unconscious". He
OL,17,Fdenied this.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
